/**
\page page_sttriggerdata2019 StTriggerData2019

\brief Concrete StTriggerData implementation for STAR Run 19 (year 2019) trigger data.

\section sec2019_overview Overview

StTriggerData2019 is the concrete implementation of the StTriggerData abstract interface for
<b>STAR Run 19 (year 2019)</b> raw trigger data.  It wraps a \c TriggerDataBlk2019 structure
(from \c StDaqLib/TRG/trgStructures2019.h) and exposes its content through the common
StTriggerData accessor API.

Compared to StTriggerData2018, Run 19 provides a complete EPD multiplicity and DSM layer
hierarchy, EPD earliest TDC, and revolution tick counters.  ETOF was installed for this run.

\section sec2019_hierarchy Class Hierarchy
\code
StObject
  └── StTriggerData          (abstract interface)
        └── StTriggerData2019
\endcode

\section sec2019_runyear Run Year
Run 19, calendar year 2019 &mdash; Au+Au at &radic;s = 14.5 GeV (BES-II); ETOF installed.

\section sec2019_datamembers Data Members

| Member | Type | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| mData  | TriggerDataBlk2019* | Pointer to the raw Run 19 trigger data block. |
| EvtDesc | EvtDescData2019* | Decoded event descriptor (transient). |
| L1_DSM  | L1_DSM_Data2019* | Decoded L1 DSM data (transient). |
| TrgSum  | TrgSumData2019* | Decoded trigger summary (transient). |
| mEQ1[11], mEQ2[11], mEQ3[11] | QTBlock2019*[11] | EPD QT crate blocks (transient). |

\section sec2019_new New Compared to 2018

<b>Revolution tick counters:</b>
- revTick1(), revTick2(), revTick3()

<b>EPD extended:</b>
- epdEarliestTDC(StBeamDirection eastwest, int prepost)
- epdLayer1a(int ch, int prepost=0)
- epdLayer1b(int ch, int prepost=0)
- epdLayer0h(int ch, int prepost=0) &mdash; returns unsigned char.
- epdNHitsQT(int crate, int qt, int mult12, int prepost=0)
- epdLayer0aMult(int ch, int prepost=0)
- epdLayer0hMult(int ch, int mult12, int prepost=0)
- epdLayer1bMult(StBeamDirection eastwest, int ring, int prepost=0)
- epdMultTotal(int prepost=0)
- epdMultDiff(int prepost=0)

\section sec2019_usage Usage Example
\code{.cpp}
StEvent* event = static_cast<StEvent*>(GetInputDS("StEvent"));
const StTriggerData* trgData = event->triggerData();
if (trgData) {
    unsigned short epdTot  = trgData->epdMultTotal(0);
    unsigned short epdDiff = trgData->epdMultDiff(0);
    unsigned int tick1     = trgData->revTick1();
}
\endcode

\see StTriggerData
\see StTriggerData2018
\see StTriggerData2022
*/
